@startuml UC-L1-view-the-audit-trail-analysis-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 60
title UC-L1 View the audit trail\n(analysis: system sequence)
' Analysis level (decision 9): the administrator and Playground as one box. No outside system takes part.
' No route, store, port, adapter, token or cookie. Step numbers are the main flow numbers of UC-L1.
' Reading writes nothing. How an entry gets into the trail is the last step of UC-A4, UC-P1 and UC-P2.

actor "Administrator" as AD
participant "Playground" as PG #E6F0FB

AD -> PG : 1 ask to see\nthe audit trail
|||
alt the person is not an administrator
  PG --> AD : 2 refused,\nno entry shown
else
  PG -> PG : 3 gather every entry,\nnewest first, account\nchanges and project\nchanges together
  |||
  PG --> AD : 4 each entry shows when, who,\nwhat, to which account\nor project, and the reason\nwhere one was asked
  |||
  note right of PG : 5 a project creation shows\nits first members,\na member change\nshows the member
end
|||
@enduml
